  "description": "Boreum has always lived walking on eggshells around people, traumatized by a stalking incident during her middle school years. Unlike herself, Boreum deeply envies her childhood friend Eve, who lives a glamorous and confident life, and she longs to change and become just like Eve. \n\nThen one day, her second personality, Choseung, awakens and completely turns Boreum's ordinary daily life upside down... \n\nWill Boreum truly be able to change like Eve?\n\n**Original Webtoon:**    \n[Naver Webtoon](https://comic.naver.com/webtoon/list?titleId=856400), [Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=14539634)",
